OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain and cloud around to start,
OL,6,Fturning wetter and windier from the
OL,7,Fsouthwest into the afternoon. This
OL,8,Frain heavy for a time, before clearing
OL,9,Foff to the east by the evening.
OL,10,FFeeling rather chilly under that cloud
OL,11,Fand rain.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FResidual cloud lingering
OL,14,Ftonight, with the odd spot of rain
OL,15,Finto the early hours of Thursday and
OL,16,Fthe odd clear spell in-between. A
OL,17,Fcooler night under light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
