OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry start for most, with
OL,6,Fshowers to the south, heavy at times.
OL,7,FTurning drier with sunny spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping through the afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling pleasant in any sunshine with
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FHeavy
OL,13,Frain on Friday with coastal gales,
OL,14,Ffuelled by Storm Austen. Turning drier
OL,15,Finto Saturday, with sunny spells
OL,16,Fbefore turning very wet and windy
OL,17,Flater. Drier but breezy on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
